@startuml List Books Sequence Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Sequence Diagram - Xem Danh Sách Sách (Admin)

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Manage Books Screen" as ManageScreen
participant "Backend API\n(BookController)" as Backend
participant "Database\n(MySQL)" as Database

Admin -> ManageScreen: Mở màn hình quản lý sách

ManageScreen -> Backend: Lấy danh sách sách\nGET /api/books/admin/all

Backend -> Database: Tìm tất cả books\nJOIN với categories, authors
Database -> Backend: Trả về danh sách books\n(với thông tin category, authors)

Backend -> ManageScreen: Trả về {books}
ManageScreen -> Admin: Hiển thị danh sách sách\n(với pagination, search, filter)

@enduml

